OL,3,GEast Midlands                          
OL,5,CToday:FAny early mist or fog quickly   
OL,6,Fclearing to leave a largely dry and    
OL,7,Fbright day with sunny spells, although 
OL,8,Fa few light showers are possible       
OL,9,Facross Lincolnshire at times.          
OL,10,FRemaining rather chilly with generally 
OL,11,Flight winds.                           
OL,13,CTonight:FTurning increasingly cloudy   
OL,14,Fduring the evening with some light     
OL,15,Frain by the morning, this may turn     
OL,16,Fsleety over high ground for a time.    
OL,17,FWinds remain light.                    
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
