OL,3,GEast Midlands                          
OL,5,CTuesday:FCloudy with a band of rain    
OL,6,Fmoving eastwards across the region,    
OL,7,Fthis could fall as sleet over high     
OL,8,Fground. Winds will increase, becoming  
OL,9,Fbreezy.                                
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,12,Fand mostly dry through the period,     
OL,13,Fwith some isolated showers on          
OL,14,FThursday. Winds easing but feeling     
OL,15,Fcool with temperatures slightly below  
OL,16,Faverage.                               
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
